title: Start
---
[b]Swipe left/right to look around.[/b]
[b]Swipe up to move forward.[/b]
[b]Swipe down to open your phone.[/b]
===

title: Story1
---
<<set_enabled_in_unity PeekoHatch true>> <<set_enabled_in_unity "Egg Hatching S" true>>
<<wait 3>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity PeekoHatch false>>
<<set_enabled_in_unity BedTamagotchi true>>
[i]The egg hatches and there it is, your new friend.[/i]
Peeko: Hi! I'm Peeko, your new best friend! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: You can play with me, talk with me and I'll always be there for you! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: Hi, I'm glad to meet you! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: We are going to have so much fun together! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
You: Hi, I'm glad to meet you! 
Peeko: We are going to have so much fun together!
[i]You're feeling a little excited[/i]
You: Hi Peeko, I'm happy to have you as a friend, 
You:but what can I really do with you?
Peeko: I'll show you around! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: Click on the Burger icon to head to the kitchen. //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: In the top left corner, you can see how hungry I am. //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: You will have to feed me when I get hungry. Let's try it out! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
===

title: Story2
---
Peeko: Hmmh Thank you! I loveee burgers //Play sound PeekoEating, play sound CharacterDIalogue
[i]After Peeko is done eating suddenly it's happiness is low.[/i]
You: Oh no Peeko, What is wrong? Please don't be sad! 
You: How can I make you happy?
Peeko: You can play with me to make me happy... //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: Go to the play room and play a game with me. //Play sound CharacterDIalogue
===

title: Story3
---
Peeko: Yay! Thank you, I had so much fun! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
You: Me too, Peeko! I'm a little tired now, So, I'll rest for a bit. But after that we can play again!
Peeko: Aww, okay, take a good rest! //Play sound CharacterDialogue

[i]Put your phone away and start heading towards your bed.[/i]
<<load_scene "Day 2">>
===